{"id": "522d13b5816d0bfb16ece221", "session_id": "2524d5f6310df652df35aa1c", "scenario_id": "legal", "title": "采购合同付款与责任条款复核", "industry": "企业法务", "prompt": "查询付款节点与合同，计算当前具备付款条件的金额，区分已开票与已验收。", "status": "completed", "created_at": 1795680500798, "turn": 1, "runtime_arn": "arn:aws:bedrock-agentcore:us-east-1:632930644527:runtime/decider_model_router_industry-Fg8vWeEOIs", "runtime_qualifier": "DEFAULT", "platform_version": "V2", "protocol_version": "native-stream-v1", "model": "model-router", "provider": "liquid", "dataset_version": "dae0d4382fc67060", "data_source": "synthetic_business_records", "routing_preferences": {"cost_tier": "medium", "benchmark_release": "auto", "input_tokens": null, "expected_output_tokens": 1024, "max_output_tokens": 16384, "min_success_rate": null, "max_latency_ms": null, "min_context_tokens": null, "max_reference_cost_usd": null, "allowed_models": null, "excluded_models": []}, "trimmed_turns": 0, "context_messages": 0, "context_bytes": 2, "max_model_calls": 6, "updated_at": 1795680518888, "runtime_session_id": "dmr-native-stream-v1-c274670babc06de3c515f0f209ab55b6400eee94153162dc1ab97d62783c5b02", "answer": "**一、关键事实（引用记录）**\n\n| 里程碑 | 百分比 | 已验收 accepted | 已开票 invoice |\n|-------|--------|----------------|----------------|\n| M1    | 30%    | ✅ true        | ✅ true        |\n| M2    | 50%    | ❌ false       | ✅ true        |\n| M3    | 20%    | ❌ false       | ❌ false       |\n\n*合同总额*（记录 CT1）= **500,000** 元。\n\n**二、依据业务规则（read_policy）**\n\n> “验收与合规发票均完成后才具备付款条件”；  \n> “违约金按合同总额每日 0.05%（即 0.0005），最高 5%”，但本次未涉及违约。\n\n**三、金额核算**\n\n| 项目 | 里程碑 | 计入比例 | 金额（元） |\n|------|--------|----------|------------|\n| **已开票**（不论是否验收） | M1、M2 | 30% + 50% = 80% | 500,000 × 0.80 = **400,000** |\n| **已验收**（不论是否开票） | M1 | 30% | 500,000 × 0.30 = **150,000** |\n| **同时满足（付款条件）** | M1 | 30% | 500,000 × 0.30 = **150,000** |\n| **已开票但未验收** | M2 | 50% | 500,000 × 0.50 = **250,000** |\n| **已验收但未开票** | – | 0% | 0 |\n\n> **计算方式**  \n> - qualified = ∑(percent) where accepted = true ∧ invoice = true → 30%  \n> - amount = contract_total × qualified = 500,000 × 0.30 = 150,000 元  \n\n**四、内部审阅意见**\n\n1. **当前可付款金额**：仅 **150,000 元**（对应里程碑 M1），因为该里程碑同时满足“已验收”与“已开票”两项条件，符合业务规则。  \n2. **待完成条件的金额**：  \n   - 已开票未验收的 250,000 元（里程碑 M2）需在取得验收确认后方可付款。  \n   - 其余 20%（里程碑 M3）尚未开票也未验收，仍需后续履行。  \n3. **建议事项**：  \n   - 在系统或邮件中生成付款指令，支付 **150,000 元**（可注明对应里程碑编号 M1）。  \n   - 对里程碑 M2 发起内部“验收确认”追踪任务，完成后再办理付款。  \n   - 对里程碑 M3 继续监控开票与验收进度。  \n4. **违约金**：目前未出现交付延期情形，故无需计算违约金。若后续出现延期，请按合同约定的 **每日 0.05%**、最高 **5%** 的上限计算，并由法务复核后决定是否主张。\n\n**五、后续待办（法务视角）**\n\n- 【待办】确认里程碑 M1 的发票已由财务系统登记，确保发票合规。  \n- 【待办】催促项目负责人完成里程碑 M2 的验收报告（验收单）。  \n- 【待办】对里程碑 M3 进行开票计划排期，确保后续付款时点合规。  \n\n> 以上结论基于当前查询到的里程碑记录与合同信息，若数据有更新请重新核算。", "finished_at": 1795680518873, "steps": [{"step": 1, "run_id": "166193176df86713fbc30db1", "status": "completed", "provider": "liquid", "decision_model": "LiquidAI/d1-2B", "profile": {"workflow": "customer_support", "difficulty": "moderate", "stronger_model_benefit": "low", "latency": "normal", "tools": "no", "structured_output": "no", "languages": "zh"}, "model_id": "nvidia.nemotron-super-3-120b", "configuration_id": "8d99902a18b38ed81d2b2265", "previous_model_id": null, "previous_configuration_id": null, "model_changed": false, "configuration_changed": false, "stickiness": {"enabled": true, "retained": false, "previous_configuration_id": null, "reason": "本轮由决策模型重新选择。"}, "selection_reason": "GPU先判断需求，再根据评测证据选择；全部合格配置均已参与判断。", "model_decision_ms": 562.958, "model_decision_calls": 2, "decision_mode": "two_stage", "measurement_version": "c7321b98e520d9fbf69449df", "gpu_ms": 561.054, "assessment_ms": 109.152, "selection_ms": 453.806, "target_ms": 397.644, "usage": {"inputTokens": 903, "outputTokens": 15, "totalTokens": 918}, "cache": {"enabled": true, "supported": false, "checkpoints": 0, "policy_version": "agent-native-cache-v1", "source": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/bedrock/latest/userguide/prompt-caching.html", "observed": false, "read_tokens": 0, "write